      "text": "Bravo Zulu to the crew of U.S. Coast Guard Cutter Midgett! Today, they offloaded 21,000+ pounds of cocaine worth $156.4M – a major win in our operations to counter narco-terrorism and protect our homeland. Through Operation Pacific Viper, @USCG is accelerating operations in the Eastern Pacific to detect, deter, and disrupt deadly narcotics before they reach our shores. \n\n#USCG #AlwaysReady #DrugInterdiction #WeOwnTheSea #EveryWarEveryShore @DHSgov",
