      "text": "Technology is transforming the Coast Guard.\n\nAboard USCGC Stone, crews are operating VBAT (a vertical takeoff drone) and Remote Aerial Systems that provide real-time surveillance and targeting support. These tools expand reach and sharpen awareness to identify narco-terrorist networks and stop drug smuggling at sea.\n\nThrough Force Design 2028, we are accelerating tech to the frontlines—giving our crews the decisive edge.\n\n#USCG #TipoftheSpear #Technology #AlwaysReady #ForceDesign2028 @DHSgov \n\nWatch the full video on our YouTube: https://t.co/G5G37F5htW",
