      "text": "The Coast Guard stands on the frontlines of maritime border security–enforcing U.S. territorial integrity and continuing our immigration enforcement mission.  \n\nThis week:\n ⚓ CGC Campbell, an HC-144 & Turks and Caicos Police intercepted an unsafe Haitian vessel w/ 103 aboard. \n\n ⚓ CGC Benjamin Bottoms interdicted 11 aliens west of Point Loma, CA. \n\nAlways ready. Always vigilant. Always on watch across U.S. maritime borders, where defense of America begins. \n\n#USCG #MaritimeSecurity #ImmigrationEnforcement #WeOwnthesea #EveryWarEveryShore @DHSgov",
