      "text": "The @USCG is investing $110.8M—partially funded by the One Big Beautiful Bill Act—to modernize our inland fleet. ⚓️ \n\nNew Waterways Commerce Cutter awards include the first river buoy tender, second construction tender, and 3 long lead time material orders. These cutters will be instrumental in sustaining the U.S. Marine Transportation System, facilitating commerce, and driving economic prosperity and strategic mobility. \n\nRead more here: https://t.co/19CAitTVqr  \n\n#USCG #Infrastructure #Innovation #WCC @DHSgov",
